OL,3,GNEWSAThe chess veteran still going
OL,4,Astrong aged 93
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Chess is like life. It's marvellous
OL,7,Fbut also very cruel," according to
OL,8,F93-year-old John Eddershaw.
OL,10,FHe should know. The veteran player from
OL,11,FSheffield has certainly lived a full
OL,12,Flife - and perhaps sometimes it has
OL,13,Ffelt cruel.
OL,15,FA man of faith, Eddershaw's father, a
OL,16,Fvicar, died when he was young. He went
OL,17,Fon to serve in the Army, represent
OL,18,FGreat Britain in race walking and
OL,19,Fmanufactured steel tools.
OL,21,FBut the one constant in his life has
OL,22,Fbeen the game of chess.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
